5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I am worried we are guessing at next year's costs again. We need real numbers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The evenings feel hesitant lately. People are waiting until the last minute to decide.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,It is always the same dozen faces doing everything. I want to see the actual workload.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer role is draining people. We need to know what we are asking of them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Newcomers are struggling to fit in. We need to keep the door open for them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if the books are a mess, how can we set a fair fee?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with @Mio. Clarity helps people feel safe enough to show up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, if the work is uneven, the fee structure should reflect that reality.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the time spent on collections. It is a hidden cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I want to see who is actually coming and who is just paying.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,Let us check the ledger. We need to know what is fixed and what is variable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
