17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the sign-in sheets. I suspect the numbers are skewed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also look at the bank statements. I want to see the payment patterns.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the taster forms. Why do people not join?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
