35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire. That is a lot.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The taster forms say people are afraid of committing to a whole year at once.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The sign-in sheets show a quarter of members do two-thirds of the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer spent six hours a month chasing individual payments. That is unsustainable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The quieter members are uneasy about what their attendance actually costs them.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if chasing payments takes so long, a flat fee might be better.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, but if people are afraid of commitment, a flat fee might scare them off.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, if the quiet members are uneasy, maybe they should only pay for what they use.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Jonathan, the mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations. That is a lot of admin.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, if we charge per event, the quiet members might feel even more excluded.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,The bank statements show a third of renewals needed reminders. That is a lot of chasing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The mid-year joiners are a pain to process. We need a simpler way.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The rota shows the same nine people do the setup. They are carrying the club.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A yearly collection takes barely one hour. That is a huge difference.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"The taster forms are clear. People want flexibility, not a big upfront bill.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think a flat fee is the only way to stop the chasing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am leaning towards activity-based. It respects the hesitation people feel.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I want to reward the people who actually show up. Activity-based seems fair.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree with @Mio. The admin burden of activity-based is too high.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I am worried about the quiet members. But I also want to keep the door open.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
