60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is flat. Option B is tiered. Option C is activity-based.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option C allows people to pay only for what they do. It feels right.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option C is fair. The people who do the work should not subsidize the absentees.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is the only one that doesn't break the treasurer. Option C is a nightmare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option B might work for newcomers. They can start small.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, but the admin for Option C is six hours a month. That is too much.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, we can automate it. Or we can accept the cost for fairness.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, automation is not enough. The work is still uneven.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the work is uneven, but the admin is the killer. I cannot support C.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, but if we choose A, the quiet members might leave.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I am voting for A. We need stability.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am voting for C. We need fairness.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I am voting for C. The heavy users should pay more.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I am voting for A. The admin burden is too high for C.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I am voting for B. It gives newcomers a way in.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I hope we can make A work.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
